theme_override_font_sizes/bold_font_size = 18
bbcode_enabled = true
text = "[b]Objective[/b]
Fight your way across each level and reach the portal to move on to the next one.

[b]Movement[/b]
[b]A[/b] / [b]D[/b] — move left / right
[b]W[/b] — jump (works off walls too, for wall-jumping)
[b]S[/b] — fast-fall / drop

[b]Power Ability — [/b][b]E[/b]
Slows down time so you can react and take control of enemies. While active:
• [b]Left-click[/b] an enemy to grab it — this freezes that enemy in place for a few seconds and, if it's a laser-type enemy, turns its beam against other enemies instead of you.
• [b]Right-click and drag[/b] on a grabbed or stationary enemy, then release, to sling it like a slingshot — the further you pull, the harder the throw. This only works while the power ability is active.

[b]Win / Lose[/b]
Reach the portal at the end of the level to win it and advance. Taking too much damage from enemy fire, or falling into a hazard zone, ends your run.

[b]Tips[/b]
• Laser-type enemies hit hard enough to one-shot other enemies — grab one and use it against the rest.
• Time your grabs: enemies stay frozen only for a few seconds before they wake back up.
• Watch your positioning — throws only work on enemies close enough to you."

